        # 1.53.7 SHADOW EXEMPT: writes the WC FB directly, NOT the fb_console shadow
        # buffer. blit is the graphical-TAKEOVER path (doom/fbtest run full-screen +
        # cli/loop — they never interleave with console text scroll), so mirroring
